{
  "technical_and_design_decisions": [
    "Adopt a shared CSS theme stylesheet and component palette between the Admin UI and the Flo graph library to ensure consistent UX.",
    "Expose runtime SPI deployer metadata (type and version) via the Spring Cloud Data Flow server REST API (`/about` or `/info` endpoint) for consumption by the UI.",
    "Implement instance scaling shell commands in the CLI client that invoke backend REST endpoints delegating to the underlying SPI deployer implementation.",
    "Perform global string and key refactoring across UI, shell, API, and documentation to transition terminology from Spring XD to Spring Cloud Data Flow and Job(s) to Task(s)."
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "Development work will be carried out by a single full-stack developer with familiarity in Java, Spring Framework, Angular/JavaScript UI frameworks, and CLI development.",
    "Lattice version 0.6.0 dependencies and binaries are published and available in standard build repositories.",
    "Documentation source files (e.g., Markdown/AsciiDoc) are stored in the project repository and can be updated directly as part of development."
  ],
  "activities": [
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-1",
      "activity_name": "Lattice 0.6.0 Upgrade & SPI Integration",
      "activity_description": "Update build dependencies to Lattice 0.6.0, refactor deployer code to adapt to breaking API changes, and verify deployer execution.",
      "most_likely_effort": 2
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-2",
      "activity_name": "Terminology Refactoring (Spring XD & Job to Task)",
      "activity_description": "Perform comprehensive replacement of 'Spring XD' references with 'Spring Cloud Data Flow' and 'Job(s)' with 'Task(s)' across UI, Shell CLI, API models, and documentation.",
      "most_likely_effort": 1.5
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-3",
      "activity_name": "Admin UI & Flo Visual Alignment",
      "activity_description": "Align styling, CSS themes, header layout, and UI components between the Admin UI and integrated Flo graph editor for visual consistency.",
      "most_likely_effort": 2.5
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-4",
      "activity_name": "About Section Version & SPI Metadata Display",
      "activity_description": "Enhance backend REST endpoint to provide version and SPI type, and update Admin UI About section/modal to display these dynamic properties.",
      "most_likely_effort": 1
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-5",
      "activity_name": "Flo Batch DSL Graph Screenshots in Documentation",
      "activity_description": "Generate Flo visual graphs for batch DSL concepts, capture screenshots, and integrate them into the user documentation.",
      "most_likely_effort": 0.5
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-6",
      "activity_name": "Architecture Design Review & Gap Analysis",
      "activity_description": "Review current architecture, identify gaps and limitations in deployer SPIs and stream/task handling, and document findings.",
      "most_likely_effort": 1
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-7",
      "activity_name": "Shell Scale Up/Down Commands Implementation",
      "activity_description": "Add new shell commands to scale module instances up/down and connect them to server REST endpoints calling SPI deployer scaling APIs.",
      "most_likely_effort": 2
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-8",
      "activity_name": "Integration Testing and Verification",
      "activity_description": "Perform end-to-end integration testing across Server, Shell CLI, Admin UI, and Flo editor to validate all implemented user stories.",
      "most_likely_effort": 1.5
    }
  ],
  "reported_total": {
    "most_likely_effort": 12
  }
}
```

